  m_text: 'Added intro cutscene

    added basement textures and lighting

    added
    procedurally animated player model

    fixed/added music and sound effects

    Renamed
    billy blunderbuss to gunther

    Fixed gunther movement speed

    shotgun shells
    now explode when shot

    fixed berserk item bug

    added controller support
    to menus

